# 统一文本为 LF，避免 Windows / WSL 之间出现「有变更、无差异」。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 常见二进制，避免被当成文本做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
